The released IrisMix weights (weights/*.safetensors) are LoRA adapters and skip-connection weights for the FLUX.2 [klein]
4B model. Their licence is set separately in weights/README.md.

Third-party models and software used by this code. They are NOT redistributed in this repository; they are downloaded
from their original sources on first use and remain under their own licences:

1. FLUX.2 [klein] 4B (black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B) - Black Forest Labs, Apache License 2.0.
   Base diffusion transformer, VAE and Qwen3 text encoder of both models.

2. Face parsing model jonathandinu/face-parsing (SegFormer, CelebAMask-HQ labels), revision
   758b82e15a0178c9db39c1ff666a8b56e3a550c8 (pinned in irismix/config.py).
   Licence stated on its model card: non-commercial research and educational use only.
   It is required at inference time (transfer rules, renderer conditions, layer recovery). As a consequence the
   pipeline as shipped may only be used for non-commercial research and education unless the parser is replaced.

3. MediaPipe Face Landmarker (face_landmarker.task) - Google, Apache License 2.0. Downloaded from the MediaPipe model
   bucket into the cache directory (irismix/config.py: LANDMARKER_URL).
